# Autonomous verification

For each defect: reproduce from current checkout/runtime; name root cause with file evidence; add or run tests; do not lower thresholds; prove locally (API + browser when UI-visible); status must match evidence.

Completion fields: STATUS, IN_PROGRESS, CURRENT_STEP, NEXT_ACTION, MANDATORY_USER_ACTION, OPTIONAL_ACCELERATION_ACTION.

Do not stop at unit tests if the claim is about local runtime behavior.
